+### Transferring users
+
+- Only org admins of the user's current organization may transfer that user.
+  Org admins of other organizations, or any caller from another organization,
+  get 404 (the path organization and the user must both be the caller's own).
+  Non-admin members of the organization get 403.
+- `toOrgId` is required (400 otherwise). Transferring to the user's current
+  organization → 400.
+- A transfer is all-or-nothing and changes the user's organization. The user
+  loses every membership in projects outside the new organization, and tasks
+  assigned to them there become unassigned. The org admin role is cleared,
+  since it does not follow the user to another organization.
+- The response is `{"id","orgId"}` with the new organization.
+
